# Density Compare
# Hafnium (Hf) — real density 13.31 g/cm³. equal masses: Hafnium vs water — sides ∝ (1/ρ)^(1/3).
scene "Hafnium Density Compare"

element_cube = cube 8.4mm color: #90b0b0 at (-20mm, 4.2mm, 0)
water_cube = cube 20mm material: water at (18mm, 10mm, 0)
# both cubes weigh the same: about 106.2 g — the water cube is the reference
